OX.** You don't need an expensive Garmin, Apple Watch Ultra, or premium sports watch to finish your first race.\n\nFor HYROX, I'd prioritize three things\\:\n\n1. **Comfort\\:** Something lightweight that won't bother you during sled pushes, burpee broad jumps, or wall balls.\n2. **Heart-rate tracking\\:** Useful for learning how hard you're pushing, especially during the running sections.\n3. **Simple workout tracking\\:** GPS, elapsed time, and lap splits are plenty for a first race.\n\nYou can also race without a watch. HYROX has its own timing system, so your official race time doesn't depend on your watch.\n\n## My budget watch recommendations\n\nI found a few options worth considering at different price points.\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn404779product0\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**1\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn404779product0\",\"Amazfit Bip 6 GPS 46mm Smartwatch with Fitness and Sleep Tra\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$79.99\n\n(Best cheap option)\n\nGPS, fitness tracking and heart-rate monitoring. A good entry-level training companion.\n\nAvailable at Target\n\n\ue200url\ue202View watch\ue202https://www.target.com/p/amazfit-bip-6-smartwatch-black/-/A-94675546?utm_medium=feed&TCID=OAG&afid=chatgpt&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn404779product1\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn404779product1\",\"Amazfit Active 2 Smart Watch 44mm, GPS Maps with Direction, \u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$99\n\n(Best budget training features)\n\nGPS, AMOLED display and extensive workout modes. Worth considering if you want more than basic tracking.\n\nAvailable at Walmart\n\n\ue200url\ue202View watch\ue202https://www.walmart.com/ip/Amazfit-Active-2-Smart-Watch-44mm-GPS-Maps-Direction-Fitness-Tracker-10-Day-Battery-Sleep-Monitor-160-Sport-Modes-Water-Resistant-Android-Apple-iPhon/15645762600?utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn404779product14\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn404779product14\",\"COROS Pace 3\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$199\n\n(Best for serious running training)\n\nLightweight, long battery life and more running-focused training features.\n\nAvailable at Snoqualmie Running\n\n\ue200url\ue202View watch\ue202https://shop.snoqualmierunning.com/products/coros-pace-3?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=51267549888817&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n**My pick\\:** I'd start with the Amazfit Bip 6 at around \\$80. I wouldn't spend \\$300\u2013\\$500 on a watch for your first HYROX.\n\nOne important race-day caveat: the 2026/27 HYROX rulebook says unlisted items are prohibited by default, and watches aren't explicitly listed as permitted. Ask your event's race director for written permission before wearing one. \ue200cite\ue202turn736723search2\ue202turn736723search4\ue201"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents/1","o":"replace","v":"Cite"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents/2","o":"replace","v":"Entity"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/requiredComponents","o":"append","v":["Link"]},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/624eac0f-78cb-533b-95ff-98c4c916401a","o":"add","v":{"status":"resolved","state":{"items":[{"url":"https://hyrox.com/rulebook/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","ref_id":"turn736723search2","refs":[{"turn_index":736723,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":2}],"source_label":"HYROX","title":"Rulebooks","snippet":null,"pub_timestamp":1637580413.0,"metadata_label":"November 22, 2021"},{"url":"https://hybridsmash.app/articles/can-you-wear-garmin-hyrox?utm_source=chatgpt.com","ref_id":"turn736723search4","refs":[{"turn_index":736723,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":4}],"source_label":"Hybrid Smash","title":"Can You Wear a Garmin in HYROX? What the Rulebook Says","snippet":null,"pub_timestamp":1791331200.0,"metadata_label":"October 7, 2026"}],"active_index":0,"sources_title":"2 Sources"},"safe_urls":["https://hyrox.com/rulebook/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","https://hybridsmash.app/articles/can-you-wear-garmin-hyrox?utm_source=chatgpt.com"],"hide_widget_feedback":true,"componentName":"Cite"}},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls","o":"append","v":["https://hyrox.com/rulebook/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","https://hybridsmash.app/articles/can-you-wear-garmin-hyrox?utm_source=chatgpt.com"]},{"p":"/message/metadata/content_references/0/safe_urls","o":"append","v":["https://hyrox.com/rulebook/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","https://hybridsmash.app/articles/can-you-wear-garmin-hyrox?utm_source=chatgpt.com"]},{"p":"/message/metadata/genui_components","o":"append","v":[{"type":"cite","tree_range":[55,56],"start_index":3294,"end_index":3350,"component_resolution_id":"624eac0f-78cb-533b-95ff-98c4c916401a","safe_urls":[{"url":"https://hyrox.com/rulebook/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"},{"url":"https://hybridsmash.app/articles/can-you-wear-garmin-hyrox?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}],"entities":[{"entity_type":"search","ref":"turn736723search2"},{"entity_type":"search","ref":"turn736723search4"}]}]}],"c":13}     

