ly listed as permitted. Ask your event's race director for written permission before wearing one. \ue200cite\ue202turn736723search2\ue202turn736723search4\ue201\n\n## What to wear for your first HYROX\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"HYROX athlete men race outfit running shorts technical shirt trainers\",\"HYROX female athlete race outfit shorts sports bra running shoes\",\"HYROX sled push competition athletes indoor arena\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"5:4\",\"layout\":\"bento\"}\ue201\n\nKeep your outfit simple\\:\n\n| Item | My recommendation |\n|--------|--------|\n| Shoes | Running shoes with good grip and stability |\n| Shorts | Lightweight running shorts or compression shorts |\n| Shirt | Breathable, moisture-wicking T-shirt or tank |\n| Socks | Technical running socks |"}],"c":13}   

